      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8vg",
          "text": "Our product liability lawyers are aggressive and relentless when building your legal claim. Our legal team will do the following, and more, on your behalf:",
