    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8w3",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8w2",
          "text": "Types of Product Liability Claims",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8w5",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8w4",
          "text": "Product liability is an area of personal injury law. A product liability claim arises from a consumer injury caused by a defective or inherently dangerous product. There are three types of defective and hazardous product claims: manufacturing defects, design defects, and failure to warn.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8w8",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8w6",
          "text": "Manufacturing defects.",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8w7",
          "text": " A defect occurs during the process of creating the product making the product dangerous.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8wb",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8w9",
          "text": "Design defects.",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8wa",
          "text": " The design of the product itself causes an unreasonable risk of harm.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8wh",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l8we",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.courts.state.co.us/userfiles/file/Court_Probation/Supreme_Court/Committees/Civil_Jury_Instructions_Committee/Chapter%2014.pdf"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8wc",
          "text": "Failure to warn.",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8wd",
          "text": " The retailer or distributor ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8wf",
          "text": "fails to provide sufficient instruction",
          "marks": [
            "l8we"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8wg",
          "text": " on how to use a product.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8wm",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l8wj",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.courts.state.co.us/userfiles/file/Court_Probation/Supreme_Court/Committees/Civil_Jury_Instructions_Committee/Chapter%2014.pdf"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8wi",
          "text": "In Colorado, the manufacturer, designer, or distributor is ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8wk",
          "text": "liable for injuries",
          "marks": [
            "l8wj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8wl",
          "text": " a consumer suffers when using the product in any foreseeable way. An injured consumer has two-years to file a product liability lawsuit in Colorado. Otherwise, they may lose any right to recover.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
